sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as order-api (Go)
    participant W as fulfillment-worker (Go)
    participant I as inventory (Node)
    participant P as pricing (Python)

    U->>A: POST /orders
    Note over A: create_order span<br/>chaos → W3C baggage
    A->>W: POST /fulfill (traceparent + baggage)
    par inventory check
        W->>I: POST /check
        I-->>W: { in_stock }
    and price computation
        W->>P: POST /price
        Note over P: honors chaos baggage<br/>(slow / error)
        P-->>W: { price_usd }
    end
    W-->>A: { price_usd, in_stock }
    A-->>U: 200 { order_id, trace_id }
